    ('respawn-spa-bali-canggu', 'bb04299c3f28248ee00f9e624a449174', 'A wellness spa in Canggu with 67 treatments, among them traditional massage, Balinese massage and body treatments. An hour of head massage costs 250K IDR, and the longest treatments run 150 minutes. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('revive-bali-canggu', '28a05af13f646d1ef1b794e522e8d0ed', 'Revive Bali is a Canggu spa with 50 treatments on its list, from manicures to foot massage and body scrubs. A traditional Balinese massage is 330K IDR for an hour, and bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('rosies-nail-bar-canggu', '4910322d92a39956f801f1052777ac14', 'Pedicures, manicures and nails all sit on the 45-treatment list at Rosies Nail Bar, a nail salon in Canggu. A 30-minute massage costs 150K IDR, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('six-senses-spas-canggu', '4360df4f03598810bf1035544c41dfc0', 'Six Senses Spas in Canggu is a wellness spa with 16 treatments, among them Javanese lulur, deep tissue and traditional massage.'),
    ('swara-spa-canggu', '1de152e8141668ac9b643736f20c49a7', 'Swara Spa, a day spa in Canggu, has 13 treatments on its list, with a couple massage alongside traditional massage and nails. Booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('the-ark-recovery-canggu', '82068cf65ae1b7d938d86b03344e054f', 'The Ark Recovery is a wellness centre in Canggu with seven treatments, deep tissue and traditional Balinese massage among them. The longest run two hours. The Flow, a traditional Balinese massage, costs 500K IDR, and booking runs through Fresha.'),
    ('the-freebird-studio-canggu', 'dd6b5cf7763b1c8979f81ca919b293aa', 'In Canggu, The Freebird Studio is a yoga studio with 14 sessions on its list, covering yoga and meditation, and the longest last two hours. Core Circuit costs 185K IDR for 60 minutes; book on the studio''s own website.'),
    ('the-path-yoga-center-canggu', '17121f6083b36347b5e7144f32d3ea53', 'At The Path Yoga Center, a yoga studio in Canggu, the six-item list runs from yoga to a spa package. A 75-minute Beginner Flow costs 165K IDR, and booking is on the centre''s own website.'),
    ('therapy-day-spa-canggu', 'e42fc19621de3de1db732f48c6da679d', 'Therapy Day Spa is a Canggu spa whose 21 treatments include scalp treatments, cream baths and spa packages. Treatments last up to three hours, and 30 minutes of reflexology costs 300K IDR. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('tonic-canggu-canggu', 'd0107b7d9df53dded48d54b029700919', 'Deep tissue, traditional and Balinese massage are among the 45 treatments at Tonic Canggu, a day spa. A one-hour foot massage costs 250K IDR, the longest treatments run three hours, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('tyce-spa-bali-canggu', '0308ace3c919ba092daa7249d39fbcf5', 'Waxing sits next to traditional massage and foot massage on the 85-treatment list at Tyce Spa Bali, a wellness spa in Canggu. An hour of foot massage costs 160K IDR, and the longest treatments run two hours. Bookings are taken on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('udara-bali-spa-canggu', '6f7a98b4beb9a3ba1cc9c957168841b5', 'Udara Bali Spa is a Canggu day spa whose 20 treatments include Balinese massage, deep tissue and foot massage. A 60-minute foot massage is 540K IDR, and the longest sessions last two and a half hours. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('umalas-canggu', '4f96cc2373b9e948e4d9917787eb3512', 'UMALAS is a massage studio in Canggu with 13 treatments, traditional massage and spa packages among them. A full-body Balinese massage costs 400K IDR for 60 minutes, and booking is on the studio''s own website.'),
    ('urban-oasis-canggu', '1621605e29d15f8b3000cdc890ed101d', 'Urban Oasis keeps its Canggu day spa list short: five treatments, among them a spa package, Thai massage and recovery sessions. An hour of Thai Flow is 550K IDR; book on the venue''s own website.'),
    ('wave-house-bali-canggu', 'f7cec064fa05c5294bfc1c94172a86b3', 'Wave House Bali is a day spa in Canggu with five treatments, including Balinese massage, body scrubs and Javanese lulur. Bookings go through its own website.'),
    ('avisha-wellness-spa-bali-jimbaran', 'c90a23a4955d7bb097d58619d2e38a69', 'With 22 treatments on its list, Avisha Wellness & Spa Bali is a day spa in Jimbaran covering traditional massage, facials and spa packages. Booking runs through Zenoti.'),
    ('ayana-spa-jimbaran', '5dcadfe91133c14aaeb387ef5cce36ee', 'AYANA Spa in Jimbaran lists 23 treatments, with reflexology alongside traditional and Balinese massage. Treatments run as long as three hours, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('balangan-surf-resort-jimbaran', '29efcfb3cc986ef1e0907c9ad313bd50', 'Balangan Surf Resort''s wellness spa in Jimbaran lists four treatments, Balinese massage among them. Booking is by WhatsApp.'),
    ('bamboo-spa-jimbaran', '806c13cec517329580e85195e125fe57', 'Foot reflexology at Bamboo Spa, a wellness spa in Jimbaran, costs 350K IDR for an hour. The 17-treatment list also has a couple massage and traditional massage, and the longest treatments run three hours. Bookings go through the spa''s own website.'),
    ('bombora-balangan-resort-jimbaran', '2d57b6043f13bcc1d187cdeb47ee0995', 'Bombora Balangan Resort runs a spa in Jimbaran with nine treatments, from sports massage to detox and hair treatments. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('calma-spa-jimbaran-jimbaran', 'dd67d5b67ae5a345bbdc0e768e8a0d71', 'Calma Spa Jimbaran is a day spa with 33 treatments, among them spa packages, body scrubs and Balinese massage. An hour of Balinese massage is 250K IDR, the longest session runs six hours, and booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('citrine-day-spa-jimbaran', '390036923c831afc6087108dd6c6542d', 'Citrine Day Spa in Jimbaran has 16 treatments on its list, and traditional massage, facials and a couple massage are among them. The longest take two and a half hours, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('de-wave-family-massage-beauty-salon-jimbaran', 'd768aeef6c1e5e7c774ac29c7adae13e', 'De WAVE is a beauty salon in Jimbaran with five treatments, including traditional massage, aromatherapy and reflexology. An hour of reflexology costs 80K IDR; bookings are made on the salon''s own website.'),
    ('jimbaran-puri-spa-jimbaran', 'c074b3bb124f4020075a28635f0ddae8', 'Jimbaran Puri Spa keeps a list of 37 treatments, including traditional massage, body scrubs and facials, and the longest run three hours. An hour of abhyanga is 1,000K IDR.'),
    ('lotus-spa-jimbaran', '31ae6e6489fe74157e487f2ec7fec150', 'Lotus Spa is a wellness spa in Jimbaran with 20 treatments, covering spa packages as well as Balinese and traditional massage. Treatments go up to two hours, and a 60-minute pregnancy massage costs 342K IDR. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('sean-spa-bali-jimbaran', '95476ea31cc0eb58051c4e962a01c9e2', 'Balinese massage, deep tissue and hot stone are among the eight treatments at Sean Spa Bali, a spa in Jimbaran. Booking is on its own website.'),
    ('swara-spa-jimbaran', '3109eb10f294d45d98b71998eee4d29a', 'A day spa in Jimbaran with 13 treatments, where a couple massage sits alongside traditional massage and nail care. Booking is on the venue''s own site.'),
    ('the-lotus-spa-jimbaran', 'a5a5557e8682361e82c75c0aa6cf8fdb', 'A Jimbaran day spa whose seven treatments include traditional massage, Balinese massage and body scrubs. The Lotus Spa takes bookings on its own website.'),
    ('anjali-spa-kuta-legian', '9c6118d3002c33cc64456045c09d6dff', 'Anjali Spa in Legian keeps to four treatments, including Balinese massage, acupressure and head massage. A traditional Balinese massage is 300K IDR for an hour, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('bali-green-spa-kuta-legian', '465fd2a91f88f49b5705a82ecc5a5dcf', 'Bali Green Spa is a Legian day spa with ten treatments, including head massage, Thai massage and spa packages. Traditional Balinese massage is 225K IDR for 60 minutes, booked on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('bali-orchid-spa-kuta-legian', '5e1940fdc20dd72342a87c07a9f9f8fb', 'Shirodhara is on the list at Bali Orchid Spa, a day spa in Legian whose ten treatments also include spa packages and Balinese massage. An hour of traditional Balinese massage costs 385K IDR; book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('body-worship-bali-kuta-legian', '884fd21e0031d82c3641237e15a356ce', 'Body Worship Bali, a wellness spa in Legian, has 75 treatments on its list, including spa packages, traditional massage and hair treatments. An hour of foot and leg massage is 155K IDR, and treatments run up to five hours.'),
    ('cozy-spa-bali-kuta-legian', '922c4dff12df6fffc564d3ce2ec2eb9e', 'COZY SPA BALI is a day spa in Legian with 16 treatments, among them reflexology, traditional massage and head massage. Its foot reflexology is 170K IDR for an hour, and bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('galuh-bali-spa-kuta-kuta-legian', '076dd599893ac8d24a948ab2ec86669f', 'Foot massage is 300K IDR for 60 minutes at Galuh Bali Spa Kuta, a spa in Legian with 28 treatments, spa packages and traditional massage among them. The longest last four hours, and booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('glory-massage-bali-kuta-legian', 'abbb51387a7141644363a4c9128c60cb', 'Nine treatments make up the list at Glory Massage Bali, a massage studio in Legian, and Balinese massage, deep tissue and aromatherapy are among them. Booking is by WhatsApp.'),
    ('glow-spa-bali-kuta-legian', 'd69ebf1669183d75588cc8490c54ba7d', 'Facials share the 65-treatment list with traditional and Balinese massage at Glow Spa Bali, a day spa in Legian. An hour of shiatsu massage costs 450K IDR, the longest treatments run four hours, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('kokuo-family-massage-reflexology-kuta-legian', '3a749e93eb8aea7b841b9cfb616a764c', 'Kokuo Family Massage & Reflexology, a day spa in Legian, has four treatments, traditional massage and reflexology among them. Booking is by WhatsApp.'),
    ('la-karma-spa-kuta-legian', '4f0a2aeeeab5791bc39504b31636b775', 'La Karma Spa is a day spa in Legian with five treatments, covering facials, spa packages and nails. The longest treatment takes two and a half hours, and booking is by WhatsApp.'),
    ('lux-day-spa-kuta-legian', 'a1f353d9bde0b62db19135d3b2bdfbd6', 'Lux Day Spa in Legian has five treatments, reflexology and nails among them. Foot reflexology is 190K IDR, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('ministry-of-villas-kuta-legian', '25141f8e6739add1cb35fcf8887fff00', 'Ministry of Villas runs a wellness centre in Legian with 11 treatments covering Balinese and traditional massage. An hour of traditional Balinese aromatherapy massage is 100K IDR.'),
    ('oaza-uluwatu-kuta-legian', '58acf0b71bf6e4abd180f2605aabcda3', 'OAZA Uluwatu is a day spa in Legian whose 11 treatments include facials, traditional massage and spa packages. A four-hand massage costs 470K IDR, treatments run up to 130 minutes, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('putu-bali-spa-home-care-kuta-legian', '2a627b21892c84ee87919c78bc11ca7e', 'Foot massage and aromatherapy are on the five-treatment list at Putu Bali Spa Home Care, a wellness spa in Legian. An hour of foot massage is 200K IDR, booked by WhatsApp.'),
    ('revitalize-massage-kuta-legian', '12c4d1a9d11bb70a71c39c4fa023d24e', 'Revitalize Massage, a massage studio in Legian, has five treatments, including spa packages, detox treatments and lymphatic massage, and the longest run two hours. Book on its own website.'),
    ('taman-air-spa-kuta-legian', '5fad575cd6da1f937efd07a0f1123a64', 'Taman Air Spa is a Legian wellness spa with 17 treatments, among them Balinese massage, a couple massage and facials. An hour of traditional Balinese massage is 290K IDR, and treatments last up to two and a half hours. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('th-home-service-spa-and-massage-kuta-legian', '0a0a0dfefb54d5dedca6bce356644dad', 'A wellness spa in Legian with seven treatments, including deep tissue, traditional massage and facials. Treatments run up to two hours; book on the venue''s own website.')
